      "message": "The ping-ponging between finder_api.go and finder_impl.go makes this hard to review.  Instead of breaking it up by exported and exported, can you move it to a single file with exported at the top and then the implementation below?  If it is too large, try to factor out a self-contained piece (like the cache?) into a separate file.",
      "revId": "e04f15a442a1a498f7095cbcb13a448f61cc5496",
