      "writtenOn": "2017-07-21T20:32:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d be somewhat surprised if using encoding/gob didn\u0027t provide enough time savings to be preferred.  Tens of MB of json seems like it should be slow to parse.",
