      "writtenOn": "2017-07-21T20:32:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It might simplify things to move this from a goroutine to the main thread that called Find*.  The main thread is just going to call WaitUntilIdle anyways.  You wouldn\u0027t need to use the sync.WaitGroup (although it is reasonable to use it anyways), because all the calls to f.requests.Add() and f.requests.Done() will come from the main thread.  As it is, the main thread calls the very first f.listDirAsync() and the rest come from this goroutine.",
